<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>HeartMath Global Coherence | Global Heart Hub</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    background:#f0f8ff;
    color:#333;
}

.container{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:2rem;
}

.header{
    background:#eaf2f8;
    padding:1.5rem;
    border-radius:10px;
    margin-bottom:1.5rem;
}

.header h1{
    margin:0;
    color:#2c3e50;
}

.subtitle{
    color:#666;
    margin-top:.5rem;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:1.5rem;
    margin-bottom:1.5rem;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 7px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
}

.card h2{
    color:maroon;
    margin-top:0;
}

.group-code{
    font-family:monospace;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    background:#f8f8f8;
    padding:.8rem;
    border-radius:6px;
    display:inline-block;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
}

.join-button{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:1rem;
    padding:.85rem 1.4rem;
    background:maroon;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:6px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.join-button:hover{
    background:#7b0000;
}

.back{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:.5rem;
    color:#315f82;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.architecture{
    text-align:center;
    line-height:2;
    background:#f8fbff;
    padding:1.5rem;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.notice{
    background:#fff8d8;
    border-left:5px solid #d4ac0d;
    padding:1rem;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.footer{
    text-align:center;
    color:#777;
    padding:1rem;
    font-size:.9rem;
}

@media(max-width:600px){
    .container{padding:1rem}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="header">
        <h1>❤️ HeartMath Global Coherence</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">
            Global Heart Hub — Heart-based community coherence
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">

        <h2>Private HeartMath Coherence Group</h2>

        <p>
            Welcome to the private coherence community connected with
            <strong>Global Heart Hub</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our group uses the HeartMath Global Coherence App
            as the external platform for participating in coherence
            practices and group activities.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Private Group Code:</strong></p>

        <div class="group-code">
            XsNNxgxqmZm0
        </div>

        <br>

        <a
            class="join-button"
            href="https://gca.heartmath.org/group?code=XsNNxgxqmZm0"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            ❤️ Join Private HeartMath Group
        </a>

    </div>

    <div class="card">

        <h2>How the Connection Works</h2>

        <div class="architecture">

            <strong>Global Heart Hub</strong>

            <br>↓<br>

            <strong>HeartMath Global Coherence Community</strong>

            <br>↓<br>

            <strong>Private GCA Group</strong>

            <br>↓<br>

            <strong>Heart-focused coherence practice</strong>

        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="card">

        <h2>Research Gateway</h2>

        <p>
            Global Heart Hub is intended to provide a broader research
            and community environment around heart-based coherence,
            including the development of the 5Cs framework and related
            computational research.
        </p>

        <div class="notice">
            <strong>Integration status:</strong>
            The current connection opens the authorized HeartMath
            Global Coherence App group. It does not imply that
            Global Heart Hub has direct access to private HeartMath
            physiological data.
        </div>

        <p>
            A future version can provide an authorized research-data
            integration if an appropriate HMI/GCA API, export mechanism,
            or institutional research interface is available.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="card">

        <h2>Global Heart Hub Vision</h2>

        <p>
            To create a bridge between heart-based practice,
            community participation, scientific investigation,
            computational modelling and human wellbeing.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Heart → Coherence → Community → Data → Science</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

    <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Global Heart Hub Dashboard</a>

    <div class="footer">
        Global Heart Hub
    </div>

</div>

